    "description": "Ball m = 1 kg launched from the origin with |v₀| = 3 m/s at θ = 60° above the horizontal. Frictionless ground, no air. Ideal range R = v₀² sin(2θ)/g ≈ 0.795 m; apex H = (v₀ sin θ)²/(2g) ≈ 0.344 m. Dynamic x and y track the ball along its trajectory."
